## BulkApi

### Get advertiser entities in bulk
## Get advertiser entities in bulk
POST https://api.pinterest.com/v5/ad_accounts/{{ad_account_id}}/bulk/download
Content-Type: application/json
Accept: application/json

{
 "campaign_filter": "<string>",
 "entity_ids": "<string>",
 "entity_types": "<string>",
 "output_format": "<string>",
 "updated_since": "<string>"
}


### Download advertiser entities in bulk
## Download advertiser entities in bulk
GET https://api.pinterest.com/v5/ad_accounts/{{ad_account_id}}/bulk/{{bulk_request_id}}?includeDetails={{includeDetails}}
Accept: application/json

### Create/update ad entities in bulk
## Create/update ad entities in bulk
POST https://api.pinterest.com/v5/ad_accounts/{{ad_account_id}}/bulk/upsert
Content-Type: application/json
Accept: application/json

{
 "create": "<string>",
 "update": "<string>"
}

